# AI Backend
A FastAPI backend for managing product data through a REST API.
Provides product creation, listing, retrieval, update, partial update, and deletion.
Uses PostgreSQL with SQLAlchemy ORM and Alembic for database migrations.
Stores 384-dimensional embeddings with the pgvector PostgreSQL extension.
Generates embeddings with `sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2`.
Supports cosine-similarity semantic product search with configurable limits and thresholds.
